{{Han etyl}}
{{Han compound|囗|或|ls=psc|c1=s|c2=p|t1=closure}}.

===Etymology===
The k-prefix derivation of {{och-l|域|boundary; territory}}. Cognate with {{och-l|閾|threshold}} and {{och-l|囿|park; garden}}.

No obvious outside cognate exists. It may be related to {{cog-lite|my|sc=Mymr|ကွက်||tr=kwak|to be marked with a square or circular pattern; to be confined to a certain area}} ({{zh-ref|Schuessler, 2007}}).

