# {{lb|zh|obs-std}} to be [[convict]]ed (of a crime)
#* {{zh-x|元狩 元年，坐 與 淮南 王 謀反，誅。|In the first year of Yuanshou, '''convicted of''' conspiring with King of Huainan to rebel, executed.|CL|ref=[[s:zh:漢書/卷016|漢書·卷十六 高惠高后文功臣表 第四]]}}

